<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dean Witter Discover cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dean Witter Discover cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz said analyst Leslie Nelkin downgraded Dean Witter Discover &amp; Co to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- said stock was removed from the recommended list.</p>
<p>-- said the &quot;task of showing greater profitability&quot; in its credit card business &quot;could become increasingly difficult in coming months.&quot;</p>
<p>-- shares fell 3/4 to 35-3/4.</p>
</text>
